{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012BGm5phmneEuHZwQqUfoiw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"sica_expanded_14b\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Expand to 200+ questions (FOLIO 104 + ProofWriter D5 108), merge with D012 for combined N=212 analysis\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_total\": 212,\n7\t      \"n_folio\": 104,\n8\t      \"n_proofwriter\": 108,\n9\t      \"sica_accuracy_combined\": 0.743,\n10\t      \"sc_accuracy_combined\": 0.722,\n11\t      \"combined_gap_pp\": 2.1,\n12\t      \"folio_sica\": 0.798,\n13\t      \"folio_sc\": 0.76,\n14\t      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.8,\n15\t      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.694,\n16\t      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.685,\n17\t      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.9,\n18\t      \"c0_combined\": 0.47,\n19\t      \"c0_folio\": 0.52,\n20\t      \"c0_proofwriter\": 0.42,\n21\t      \"bootstrap_p_combined\": 0.088,\n22\t      \"bootstrap_p_folio\": 0.062,\n23\t      \"bootstrap_p_proofwriter\": 0.41,\n24\t      \"tiebreak_instances_total\": 28,\n25\t      \"tiebreak_sica_wins\": 18,\n26\t      \"tiebreak_sica_losses\": 10,\n27\t      \"tiebreak_win_rate\": 0.643,\n28\t      \"total_constraints_raw\": 19840,\n29\t      \"total_constraints_unique\": 5120,\n30\t      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.031,\n31\t      \"wall_time_min\": 205\n32\t    },\n33\t    \"tables\": [\n34\t      {\n35\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Expanded Results (N=212)\",\n36\t        \"columns\": [\n37\t          \"Dataset\",\n38\t          \"N\",\n39\t          \"SC_Acc\",\n40\t          \"SICA_Acc\",\n41\t          \"Gap_pp\",\n42\t          \"p_bootstrap\",\n43\t          \"C0\"\n44\t        ],\n45\t        \"rows\": [\n46\t          [\n47\t            \"FOLIO\",\n48\t            104,\n49\t            76.0,\n50\t            79.8,\n51\t            \"+3.8\",\n52\t            0.062,\n53\t            0.52\n54\t          ],\n55\t          [\n56\t            \"ProofWriter\",\n57\t            108,\n58\t            68.5,\n59\t            69.4,\n60\t            \"+0.9\",\n61\t            0.41,\n62\t            0.42\n63\t          ],\n64\t          [\n65\t            \"Combined\",\n66\t            212,\n67\t            72.2,\n68\t            74.3,\n69\t            \"+2.1\",\n70\t            0.088,\n71\t            0.47\n72\t          ]\n73\t        ]\n74\t      },\n75\t      {\n76\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Tiebreak Resolution Analysis\",\n77\t        \"columns\": [\n78\t          \"Dataset\",\n79\t          \"Ties\",\n80\t          \"SICA_Win\",\n81\t          \"SICA_Loss\",\n82\t          \"Win_Rate\"\n83\t        ],\n84\t        \"rows\": [\n85\t          [\n86\t            \"FOLIO\",\n87\t            16,\n88\t            11,\n89\t            5,\n90\t            0.688\n91\t          ],\n92\t          [\n93\t            \"ProofWriter\",\n94\t            12,\n95\t            7,\n96\t            5,\n97\t            0.583\n98\t          ],\n99\t          [\n100\t            \"Combined\",\n101\t            28,\n102\t            18,\n103\t            10,\n104\t            0.643\n105\t          ]\n106\t        ]\n107\t      }\n108\t    ],\n109\t    \"figures\": [],\n110\t    \"analysis\": \"Combined gap +2.1pp with p=0.088 supports \\\"consistent positive direction\\\" framing but not strong significance. FOLIO单独p=0.062接近显著，是论文最强evidence。ProofWriter的+0.9pp在噪声范围内。 Tiebreak win rate 64.3%显著优于random 50% (binomial p=0.096, N=28)， 但不如D012的100% (4/4)——确认小样本膨胀效应。 策略：report one-sided p<0.10 for combined, 强调effect direction一致性跨两个dataset， ProofWriter作为\\\"boundary condition\\\"证据——当domain FOL结构规则时SICA增益边际化。\\n\\n\\nFOLIO gap从D012的+6.7pp缩小到+3.8pp，因为原始60题中4个tiebreak全胜是小样本运气—— 扩展后tiebreak实例从4增到~15，SICA胜率从100%回归到~65%（部分tie中约束质量不足以区分正确答案）。 ProofWriter维持近零增益(+0.9pp, p=0.41不显著)：PW的FOL结构规则，模型提取的约束同质性高， tie本身就少(C0=0.42 vs FOLIO的0.52)，且tie中约束权重无法有效区分——PW的错误更多来自 推理链遗漏前提而非逻辑矛盾。Combined bootstrap p=0.088落在0.05-0.15区间： 单侧可argue方向性证据(p<0.10)，但双侧检验不显著(p=0.176)。\\n\"\n111\t  },\n112\t  {\n113\t    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n114\t    \"description\": \"K=6,8,12,16,20 sensitivity on D012's 60 questions, analyzing tiebreak frequency and SICA gap as function of K\",\n115\t    \"results\": {\n116\t      \"k6_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n117\t      \"k6_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n118\t      \"k6_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n119\t      \"k6_tie_count\": 6,\n120\t      \"k6_c0\": 0.48,\n121\t      \"k8_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n122\t      \"k8_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n123\t      \"k8_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n124\t      \"k8_tie_count\": 5,\n125\t      \"k8_c0\": 0.5,\n126\t      \"k10_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n127\t      \"k10_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n128\t      \"k10_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n129\t      \"k10_tie_count\": 4,\n130\t      \"k10_c0\": 0.533,\n131\t      \"k12_sica_acc\": 0.75,\n132\t      \"k12_sc_acc\": 0.717,\n133\t      \"k12_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n134\t      \"k12_tie_count\": 3,\n135\t      \"k12_c0\": 0.55,\n136\t      \"k16_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n137\t      \"k16_sc_acc\": 0.717,\n138\t      \"k16_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n139\t      \"k16_tie_count\": 2,\n140\t      \"k16_c0\": 0.58,\n141\t      \"k20_sica_acc\": 0.75,\n142\t      \"k20_sc_acc\": 0.733,\n143\t      \"k20_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n144\t      \"k20_tie_count\": 2,\n145\t      \"k20_c0\": 0.6,\n146\t      \"k_gap_correlation_r\": 0.52,\n147\t      \"k_gap_correlation_p\": 0.29,\n148\t      \"odd_k_check_k9_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n149\t      \"odd_k_check_k11_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n150\t      \"wall_time_hours\": 4.8\n151\t    },\n152\t    \"tables\": [\n153\t      {\n154\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: K Sensitivity Analysis (N=60)\",\n155\t        \"columns\": [\n156\t          \"K\",\n157\t          \"SC_Acc\",\n158\t          \"SICA_Acc\",\n159\t          \"Gap_pp\",\n160\t          \"Ties\",\n161\t          \"Tie_SICA_Wins\",\n162\t          \"C0\"\n163\t        ],\n164\t        \"rows\": [\n165\t          [\n166\t            6,\n167\t            70.0,\n168\t            71.7,\n169\t            \"+1.7\",\n170\t            6,\n171\t            4,\n172\t            0.48\n173\t          ],\n174\t          [\n175\t            8,\n176\t            70.0,\n177\t            73.3,\n178\t            \"+3.3\",\n179\t            5,\n180\t            4,\n181\t            0.5\n182\t          ],\n183\t          [\n184\t            \"10*\",\n185\t            70.0,\n186\t            73.3,\n187\t            \"+3.3\",\n188\t            4,\n189\t            4,\n190\t            0.53\n191\t          ],\n192\t          [\n193\t            12,\n194\t            71.7,\n195\t            75.0,\n196\t            \"+3.3\",\n197\t            3,\n198\t            3,\n199\t            0.55\n200\t          ],\n201\t          [\n202\t            16,\n203\t            71.7,\n204\t            73.3,\n205\t            \"+1.7\",\n206\t            2,\n207\t            2,\n208\t            0.58\n209\t          ],\n210\t          [\n211\t            20,\n212\t            73.3,\n213\t            75.0,\n214\t            \"+1.7\",\n215\t            2,\n216\t            2,\n217\t            0.6\n218\t          ]\n219\t        ]\n220\t      },\n221\t      {\n222\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Odd K Control\",\n223\t        \"columns\": [\n224\t          \"K\",\n225\t          \"SC_Acc\",\n226\t          \"SICA_Acc\",\n227\t          \"Gap_pp\",\n228\t          \"Ties\"\n229\t        ],\n230\t        \"rows\": [\n231\t          [\n232\t            9,\n233\t            70.0,\n234\t            70.0,\n235\t            \"0.0\",\n236\t            0\n237\t          ],\n238\t          [\n239\t            11,\n240\t            71.7,\n241\t            71.7,\n242\t            \"0.0\",\n243\t            0\n244\t          ]\n245\t        ]\n246\t      }\n247\t    ],\n248\t    \"figures\": [],\n249\t    \"analysis\": \"K消融的核心价值不是找最优K，而是mechanistic proof：odd K → 0 gap确认SICA的 entire gain来自tiebreak resolution，非其他pathway。这是defense against reviewer \\\"SICA只是噪声\\\"的strongest evidence——噪声不会在odd/even间产生系统性差异。 Non-monotonicity (K=16 gap < K=12 gap)因为高K时tie概率指数下降， 不损害论文claims——反而支持\\\"SICA operates specifically on ties\\\"的precision。 r=0.52不够strong predictor，在论文中报告为\\\"directional\\\"而非\\\"predictive\\\"。\\n\\n\\nK消融方向正确但非单调：偶数K有tiebreak可能（结构性），奇数K几乎无精确tie。 K=8和K=10(D012原始)表现最好——K足够大产生diversity但tie概率尚可。 K=6时tie最多(6个)因为6:0/5:1/4:2/3:3分布中3:3概率~31%（二项分布近似）， 但每个tie只有6条trace的约束信息，解析力弱，SICA只赢4/6。 K=16/20时tie极少（精确8:8或10:10概率<5%），SICA几乎无用武之地—— 但SC本身准确率上升（更多vote稳定了majority）。 相关性r=0.52说明K与gap有正方向关联但p=0.29（仅5个点），不能claim统计关系。 核心发现：SICA benefit的来源确实是tiebreaking——在odd K实验中gap精确归零， 这是mechanistic validation而非statistical claim。\\n\"\n250\t  },\n251\t  {\n252\t    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n253\t    \"description\": \"CPU reanalysis: SICA vs SC-random-tiebreak vs SC-alphabetical on all 60 D012 questions\",\n254\t    \"results\": {\n255\t      \"sc_deterministic_acc\": 0.7,\n256\t      \"sc_random_acc_mean\": 0.717,\n257\t      \"sc_random_acc_std\": 0.023,\n258\t      \"sica_acc\": 0.733,\n259\t      \"sica_vs_deterministic_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n260\t      \"sica_vs_random_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n261\t      \"random_vs_deterministic_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n262\t      \"sica_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.22,\n263\t      \"tiebreak_sica_correct\": 3,\n264\t      \"tiebreak_random_expected_correct\": 2.0,\n265\t      \"tiebreak_deterministic_correct\": 1,\n266\t      \"total_ties\": 4,\n267\t      \"n_questions\": 60\n268\t    },\n269\t    \"tables\": [\n270\t      {\n271\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Tiebreak Baseline Comparison (D012, N=60)\",\n272\t        \"columns\": [\n273\t          \"Method\",\n274\t          \"Accuracy\",\n275\t          \"Gap_vs_SICA\",\n276\t          \"Ties_Correct\",\n277\t          \"p_vs_SICA\"\n278\t        ],\n279\t        \"rows\": [\n280\t          [\n281\t            \"SC-Deterministic\",\n282\t            \"70.0%\",\n283\t            \"-3.3pp\",\n284\t            \"1/4\",\n285\t            0.317\n286\t          ],\n287\t          [\n288\t            \"SC-Random (mean)\",\n289\t            \"71.7%\",\n290\t            \"-1.7pp\",\n291\t            \"2.0/4\",\n292\t            0.22\n293\t          ],\n294\t          [\n295\t            \"SICA\",\n296\t            \"73.3%\",\n297\t            \"—\",\n298\t            \"3/4\",\n299\t            \"—\"\n300\t          ]\n301\t        ]\n302\t      }\n303\t    ],\n304\t    \"figures\": [],\n305\t    \"analysis\": \"这个实验对论文framing至关重要：必须承认SC-random是比SC-deterministic更公平的baseline。 SICA vs random在D012上不显著，但在exp-001的expanded data(28 ties, 64.3% win rate)上 binomial test给p=0.096——边缘但可报告。论文策略：(1)承认deterministic baseline inflates gap， (2)报告vs random的gap和p值transparently，(3)argue即使vs random，64.3% win rate 在repeated application中有practical value，(4)odd/even K实验作为mechanistic证据 补充statistical weakness。\\n\\n\\nD012有4个tie (6:6 splits)。SC-deterministic在这4个tie中只答对1个(alphabetical bias)。 SC-random期望答对2个(50% per tie × 4 ties)。SICA答对3个(75% win rate on ties)。 所以SICA vs random的gap只有+1.7pp(1个额外正确)，而vs deterministic是+3.3pp(2个额外正确)。 在仅4个tie的small sample上，SICA vs random的p值很高(0.22)——无法统计区分。 但这正是median档的定义：方向正确，统计力不足。需要exp-001的28个tie来获得更好的power。 关键insight：D012报告的+3.3pp gap中，约一半来自deterministic tiebreak的系统性bias (alphabetical偏向错误答案)，另一半来自SICA的真实constraint-based resolution。\\n\"\n306\t  },\n307\t  {\n308\t    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n309\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on same 60 D012 questions, testing C0-as-predictor hypothesis\",\n310\t    \"results\": {\n311\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.683,\n312\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.65,\n313\t      \"sica_sc_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n314\t      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.633,\n315\t      \"c0_folio\": 0.7,\n316\t      \"c0_proofwriter\": 0.57,\n317\t      \"folio_sica\": 0.733,\n318\t      \"folio_sc\": 0.7,\n319\t      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n320\t      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.633,\n321\t      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.6,\n322\t      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n323\t      \"bootstrap_p_combined\": 0.18,\n324\t      \"tiebreak_instances\": 7,\n325\t      \"tiebreak_sica_wins\": 5,\n326\t      \"tiebreak_win_rate\": 0.714,\n327\t      \"constraint_quality_degradation\": 0.15,\n328\t      \"extraction_failures\": 3,\n329\t      \"wall_time_min\": 35\n330\t    },\n331\t    \"tables\": [\n332\t      {\n333\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Model Scaling Comparison\",\n334\t        \"columns\": [\n335\t          \"Model\",\n336\t          \"Params\",\n337\t          \"C0\",\n338\t          \"SC_Acc\",\n339\t          \"SICA_Acc\",\n340\t          \"Gap_pp\",\n341\t          \"Ties\",\n342\t          \"Win_Rate\"\n343\t        ],\n344\t        \"rows\": [\n345\t          [\n346\t            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n347\t            \"7B\",\n348\t            0.63,\n349\t            65.0,\n350\t            68.3,\n351\t            \"+3.3\",\n352\t            7,\n353\t            0.714\n354\t          ],\n355\t          [\n356\t            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n357\t            \"14B\",\n358\t            0.53,\n359\t            70.0,\n360\t            73.3,\n361\t            \"+3.3\",\n362\t            4,\n363\t            0.75\n364\t          ],\n365\t          [\n366\t            \"QwQ-32B (reasoning)\",\n367\t            \"32B\",\n368\t            0.036,\n369\t            72.7,\n370\t            72.7,\n371\t            \"0.0\",\n372\t            0,\n373\t            \"N/A\"\n374\t          ]\n375\t        ]\n376\t      }\n377\t    ],\n378\t    \"figures\": [],\n379\t    \"analysis\": \"7B结果validates Claim 2的direction但complicates Claim 3。C0确实higher且有增益(vs QwQ的0)， 但gap大小不随C0线性增长。论文需将Claim 3从\\\"C0 predicts magnitude\\\"弱化为 \\\"C0 predicts whether SICA will help (binary gate)\\\"——threshold约在C0>20%时有增益， <5%时无增益，但20-70%区间内magnitude由constraint quality而非C0 alone决定。 7B的PW增益是surprise(14B上为0)——可能因为sample size或因为7B的error pattern不同。 不过度interpret，在论文中note为\\\"suggestive but N too small for conclusion\\\"。\\n\\n\\n7B模型更弱→答案更分散→C0从14B的0.53升到0.63(符合0.55-0.70区间)。 更多tie instances(7 vs 14B的4)给SICA更多resolution机会。 但constraint质量下降：7B的FOL提取更noisy(3个extraction failures，约束语义准确率降低)。 净效果：gap_pp=3.3与14B相同(不是更大)——higher C0带来更多opportunity但lower constraint quality降低per-tie win rate。这验证了C0预测方向(7B有增益)但关系非线性： C0从0.53→0.63(+19%)，gap从3.3→3.3(+0%)，因为constraint quality是confounding factor。 ProofWriter在7B上意外出现+3.3pp——因为7B在PW上错误更多且更diverse(不像14B那样 一致性地犯同一种错误)，给SICA提供了differentiation空间。但N=30, p=0.18不显著。\\n\"\n380\t  },\n381\t  {\n382\t    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n383\t    \"description\": \"Cross-model C0 vs SICA-SC gap scatter plot and correlation analysis\",\n384\t    \"results\": {\n385\t      \"data_points\": 8,\n386\t      \"models_included\": [\n387\t        \"Qwen2.5-7B\",\n388\t        \"Qwen2.5-14B\",\n389\t        \"QwQ-32B\"\n390\t      ],\n391\t      \"k_values_included\": [\n392\t        6,\n393\t        8,\n394\t        10,\n395\t        12,\n396\t        16,\n397\t        20\n398\t      ],\n399\t      \"pearson_r\": 0.58,\n400\t      \"pearson_p\": 0.13,\n401\t      \"spearman_rho\": 0.64,\n402\t      \"spearman_p\": 0.086,\n403\t      \"binary_gate_accuracy\": 1.0,\n404\t      \"binary_gate_threshold_c0\": 0.2,\n405\t      \"above_threshold_mean_gap\": 2.6,\n406\t      \"below_threshold_mean_gap\": 0.0,\n407\t      \"r_within_instruction_models\": 0.41\n408\t    },\n409\t    \"tables\": [\n410\t      {\n411\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: C0 Diagnostic Summary\",\n412\t        \"columns\": [\n413\t          \"Model\",\n414\t          \"K\",\n415\t          \"C0\",\n416\t          \"Gap_pp\",\n417\t          \"Regime\"\n418\t        ],\n419\t        \"rows\": [\n420\t          [\n421\t            \"QwQ-32B\",\n422\t            10,\n423\t            0.036,\n424\t            0.0,\n425\t            \"degenerate\"\n426\t          ],\n427\t          [\n428\t            \"14B-Instruct\",\n429\t            6,\n430\t            0.48,\n431\t            1.7,\n432\t            \"active\"\n433\t          ],\n434\t          [\n435\t            \"14B-Instruct\",\n436\t            8,\n437\t            0.5,\n438\t            3.3,\n439\t            \"active\"\n440\t          ],\n441\t          [\n442\t            \"14B-Instruct\",\n443\t            10,\n444\t            0.53,\n445\t            3.3,\n446\t            \"active\"\n447\t          ],\n448\t          [\n449\t            \"14B-Instruct\",\n450\t            12,\n451\t            0.55,\n452\t            3.3,\n453\t            \"active\"\n454\t          ],\n455\t          [\n456\t            \"14B-Instruct\",\n457\t            16,\n458\t            0.58,\n459\t            1.7,\n460\t            \"active\"\n461\t          ],\n462\t          [\n463\t            \"14B-Instruct\",\n464\t            20,\n465\t            0.6,\n466\t            1.7,\n467\t            \"active\"\n468\t          ],\n469\t          [\n470\t            \"7B-Instruct\",\n471\t            10,\n472\t            0.63,\n473\t            3.3,\n474\t            \"active\"\n475\t          ]\n476\t        ]\n477\t      }\n478\t    ],\n479\t    \"figures\": [],\n480\t    \"analysis\": \"C0 validation的核心结论：C0是excellent binary classifier (reasoning vs instruction regime) 但poor quantitative predictor within the active regime。论文应present C0 as \\\"practitioner decision tool\\\"——compute C0 on small pilot (5-10 questions), if <10% don't deploy SICA, if >20% SICA will likely help。不claim C0 predicts how much it helps。 这是median档的typical outcome：方向性insight成立但quantitative precision不足。\\n\\n\\n跨所有模型和K值，共8个独立数据点(7B×1, 14B×6 K values, QwQ×1)。 Pearson r=0.58主要由QwQ的极端点(C0≈0.04, gap=0)驱动——去掉QwQ后 只在instruction models间r=0.41(weak)。这说明C0作为binary gate很强 (C0>20% → 有增益, <5% → 无增益, accuracy=100%)，但作为magnitude predictor很弱。 Spearman rho=0.64稍好因为不假设线性关系。p=0.086/0.13在边缘—— 8个点的power本身就不够做strong correlation claim。 这决定了Claim 3在论文中的framing：diagnostic gate而非quantitative predictor。\\n\"\n481\t  },\n482\t  {\n483\t    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n484\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on 60 questions for scaling curve\",\n485\t    \"results\": {\n486\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.783,\n487\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.767,\n488\t      \"sica_sc_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n489\t      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.35,\n490\t      \"folio_sica\": 0.867,\n491\t      \"folio_sc\": 0.833,\n492\t      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n493\t      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.7,\n494\t      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.7,\n495\t      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n496\t      \"tiebreak_instances\": 2,\n497\t      \"tiebreak_sica_wins\": 1,\n498\t      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.35,\n499\t      \"wall_time_min\": 180\n500\t    },\n501\t    \"tables\": [\n502\t      {\n503\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: Full Scaling Curve\",\n504\t        \"columns\": [\n505\t          \"Model\",\n506\t          \"Type\",\n507\t          \"Params\",\n508\t          \"C0\",\n509\t          \"SC_Acc\",\n510\t          \"SICA_Acc\",\n511\t          \"Gap_pp\"\n512\t        ],\n513\t        \"rows\": [\n514\t          [\n515\t            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n516\t            \"instruction\",\n517\t            \"7B\",\n518\t            0.63,\n519\t            65.0,\n520\t            68.3,\n521\t            \"+3.3\"\n522\t          ],\n523\t          [\n524\t            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n525\t            \"instruction\",\n526\t            \"14B\",\n527\t            0.53,\n528\t            70.0,\n529\t            73.3,\n530\t            \"+3.3\"\n531\t          ],\n532\t          [\n533\t            \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ\",\n534\t            \"instruction\",\n535\t            \"72B\",\n536\t            0.35,\n537\t            76.7,\n538\t            78.3,\n539\t            \"+1.7\"\n540\t          ],\n541\t          [\n542\t            \"QwQ-32B\",\n543\t            \"reasoning\",\n544\t            \"32B\",\n545\t            0.04,\n546\t            72.7,\n547\t            72.7,\n548\t            \"0.0\"\n549\t          ]\n550\t        ]\n551\t      }\n552\t    ],\n553\t    \"figures\": [],\n554\t    \"analysis\": \"72B填充了scaling curve但statistical power极弱。Camera-ready decision： 如果72B支持narrative(C0随size降)则include as one data point in Fig 9。 如果reviewer要求removal(not significant)可safely drop。不是essential evidence。 Key insight for paper：instruction model scaling是C0的continuous axis， reasoning model training是discontinuous regime shift——architecture > scale for C0。\\n\\n\\n72B是instruction model但更强→更self-consistent→C0降到0.35(14B的0.53和QwQ的0.036之间)。 SC baseline更高(76.7% vs 14B的70.0%)——stronger model少犯错。 Ties更少(仅2个)因为72B的majority更decisive。SICA仅赢1/2 ties，gap=1.7pp。 bootstrap p=0.35完全不显著(N=60, 仅1题差异)。 这对论文的价值：confirms scaling trend (bigger instruction model → lower C0 → less SICA benefit)， 支撑\\\"instruction model size是operating regime的gradual axis\\\"的narrative。 但统计上是noise——camera-ready inclusion取决于是否加强story还是dilute it。\\n\"\n555\t  },\n556\t  {\n557\t    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n558\t    \"description\": \"Qualitative analysis of 5-10 representative questions from exp-001 expanded data\",\n559\t    \"results\": {\n560\t      \"questions_analyzed\": 8,\n561\t      \"categories\": {\n562\t        \"sica_correct_tie_won\": 3,\n563\t        \"sica_correct_tie_lost\": 1,\n564\t        \"non_tie_agreement\": 3,\n565\t        \"extraction_failure\": 1\n566\t      },\n567\t      \"findings\": {\n568\t        \"constraints_semantic_accuracy\": 0.72,\n569\t        \"excluded_correspond_to_errors\": 0.67,\n570\t        \"constraint_redundancy_rate\": 0.45,\n571\t        \"meaningful_weight_differentiation\": 0.625\n572\t      },\n573\t      \"case_highlights\": [\n574\t        {\n575\t          \"type\": \"SICA win — correct constraint weighting\",\n576\t          \"description\": \"FOLIO q47: 6:6 tie, correct answer's traces produce 12 unique non-contradictory constraints vs 8 for incorrect answer. MaxSAT weight correctly resolves.\"\n577\t        },\n578\t        {\n579\t          \"type\": \"SICA loss — noisy extraction\",\n580\t          \"description\": \"FOLIO q82: 6:6 tie, incorrect answer has more constraints due to verbose but flawed reasoning chain. Quantity overwhelms quality.\"\n581\t        },\n582\t        {\n583\t          \"type\": \"Non-tie validation\",\n584\t          \"description\": \"PW q33: 8:2 majority correct, SICA confirms — excluded constraints (2) both from minority incorrect traces.\"\n585\t        }\n586\t      ]\n587\t    },\n588\t    \"tables\": [],\n589\t    \"figures\": [],\n590\t    \"analysis\": \"Case studies在median档是论文的critical补充——当statistical evidence是borderline时， mechanistic transparency builds reviewer trust。Strategy：选最clean的SICA-win case 作为motivating example(可能放Section 1)，选一个failure case放Section 5 limitations。 Constraint quality = 72% accuracy confirms SICA不是\\\"optimal\\\"——future work可improve extraction quality (better prompting, verification step) for stronger gains。 这也explains为什么C0 alone不predict gap magnitude：constraint quality是hidden variable。\\n\\n\\nMedian档的constraint quality是\\\"good enough to beat random but not reliably correct\\\"。 72%语义准确率意味着约28%的约束是noisy或错误的——这解释了为什么tiebreak win rate是 64-75%而非接近100%。Excluded constraints 67%对应真实推理错误——有意义但不完美。 45%冗余率说明不同traces经常提取相同约束(同一推理步骤)，constraint diversity比trace diversity低。 Case studies的价值：为reviewer提供\\\"mechanistic understanding\\\"的concrete evidence， 补充纯statistical evidence的不足。一个好的SICA-win case + 一个failure case = honest presentation。\\n\"\n591\t  },\n592\t  {\n593\t    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n594\t    \"description\": \"Wall-time breakdown per phase on exp-001 data\",\n595\t    \"results\": {\n596\t      \"avg_total_time_per_question_s\": 58.2,\n597\t      \"breakdown\": {\n598\t        \"generation_s\": 42.5,\n599\t        \"generation_pct\": 73.0,\n600\t        \"constraint_extraction_s\": 12.8,\n601\t        \"constraint_extraction_pct\": 22.0,\n602\t        \"maxsat_solving_s\": 0.3,\n603\t        \"maxsat_solving_pct\": 0.5,\n604\t        \"answer_aggregation_s\": 2.6,\n605\t        \"answer_aggregation_pct\": 4.5\n606\t      },\n607\t      \"sc_equivalent_time_s\": 42.5,\n608\t      \"sica_overhead_vs_sc_pct\": 37.0,\n609\t      \"sica_overhead_absolute_s\": 15.7,\n610\t      \"marginal_cost_per_question_extraction_only\": \"$0.003\",\n611\t      \"total_run_cost_212q\": \"$0.64\",\n612\t      \"maxsat_timeout_rate\": 0.005,\n613\t      \"batch_throughput_questions_per_hour\": 62\n614\t    },\n615\t    \"tables\": [\n616\t      {\n617\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: Computational Overhead Analysis\",\n618\t        \"columns\": [\n619\t          \"Phase\",\n620\t          \"Time_s\",\n621\t          \"Pct_Total\",\n622\t          \"Shared_with_SC\"\n623\t        ],\n624\t        \"rows\": [\n625\t          [\n626\t            \"Trace Generation (K=10)\",\n627\t            42.5,\n628\t            \"73%\",\n629\t            true\n630\t          ],\n631\t          [\n632\t            \"Constraint Extraction\",\n633\t            12.8,\n634\t            \"22%\",\n635\t            false\n636\t          ],\n637\t          [\n638\t            \"MaxSAT Solving\",\n639\t            0.3,\n640\t            \"0.5%\",\n641\t            false\n642\t          ],\n643\t          [\n644\t            \"Answer Aggregation\",\n645\t            2.6,\n646\t            \"4.5%\",\n647\t            \"Partial\"\n648\t          ],\n649\t          [\n650\t            \"Total\",\n651\t            58.2,\n652\t            \"100%\",\n653\t            \"—\"\n654\t          ],\n655\t          [\n656\t            \"SICA Marginal Overhead\",\n657\t            15.7,\n658\t            \"37%*\",\n659\t            \"—\"\n660\t          ]\n661\t        ]\n662\t      }\n663\t    ],\n664\t    \"figures\": [],\n665\t    \"analysis\": \"Overhead analysis的framing：不是\\\"SICA costs 37% more\\\"而是\\\"SICA adds 16s per question on top of generation that SC already requires\\\"。Dollar cost framing($0.003/question marginal) 更compelling than percentage。Reviewer可能ask \\\"why not just increase K instead of adding extraction overhead?\\\"——answer from exp-002: increasing K alone doesn't help when ties still occur and random resolution is needed; SICA resolves ties principally regardless of K。\\n\\nGeneration (K=10 traces)是bottleneck且SC也需要这步——所以SICA的marginal overhead 仅是constraint extraction(22%)和MaxSAT(0.5%)。MaxSAT solving几乎instant(<1s per problem) 因为constraint数量小(~30 unique per problem)，Z3处理trivial。 Extraction是主要overhead source：每条trace需要LLM call提取FOL(或regex parsing)。 37% overhead在\\\"是否worth it\\\"的argument中是reasonable——如果gain是+2-4pp on a benchmark where random gets 50% and state-of-art gets 75%，+2pp是meaningful improvement at moderate cost。 但reviewer可能argue\\\"37% more compute for 2pp gain is not practical\\\"—— defense: (1) generation cost is sunk (user already runs SC), (2) extraction可batch/parallelize, (3) marginal dollar cost <$1 for full benchmark run。\\n\"\n666\t  }\n667\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"46b79754-4c0b-40a8-861c-f0eb2429fe5e","uuid":"b265ddda-6935-4bef-a5bd-63f033552c4e","timestamp":"2026-05-16T05:33:29.933Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T051642/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_expanded_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"Expand to 200+ questions (FOLIO 104 + ProofWriter D5 108), merge with D012 for combined N=212 analysis\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_total\": 212,\n      \"n_folio\": 104,\n      \"n_proofwriter\": 108,\n      \"sica_accuracy_combined\": 0.743,\n      \"sc_accuracy_combined\": 0.722,\n      \"combined_gap_pp\": 2.1,\n      \"folio_sica\": 0.798,\n      \"folio_sc\": 0.76,\n      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.8,\n      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.694,\n      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.685,\n      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.9,\n      \"c0_combined\": 0.47,\n      \"c0_folio\": 0.52,\n      \"c0_proofwriter\": 0.42,\n      \"bootstrap_p_combined\": 0.088,\n      \"bootstrap_p_folio\": 0.062,\n      \"bootstrap_p_proofwriter\": 0.41,\n      \"tiebreak_instances_total\": 28,\n      \"tiebreak_sica_wins\": 18,\n      \"tiebreak_sica_losses\": 10,\n      \"tiebreak_win_rate\": 0.643,\n      \"total_constraints_raw\": 19840,\n      \"total_constraints_unique\": 5120,\n      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.031,\n      \"wall_time_min\": 205\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Expanded Results (N=212)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Dataset\",\n          \"N\",\n          \"SC_Acc\",\n          \"SICA_Acc\",\n          \"Gap_pp\",\n          \"p_bootstrap\",\n          \"C0\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"FOLIO\",\n            104,\n            76.0,\n            79.8,\n            \"+3.8\",\n            0.062,\n            0.52\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ProofWriter\",\n            108,\n            68.5,\n            69.4,\n            \"+0.9\",\n            0.41,\n            0.42\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Combined\",\n            212,\n            72.2,\n            74.3,\n            \"+2.1\",\n            0.088,\n            0.47\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Tiebreak Resolution Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Dataset\",\n          \"Ties\",\n          \"SICA_Win\",\n          \"SICA_Loss\",\n          \"Win_Rate\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"FOLIO\",\n            16,\n            11,\n            5,\n            0.688\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ProofWriter\",\n            12,\n            7,\n            5,\n            0.583\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Combined\",\n            28,\n            18,\n            10,\n            0.643\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Combined gap +2.1pp with p=0.088 supports \\\"consistent positive direction\\\" framing but not strong significance. FOLIO单独p=0.062接近显著，是论文最强evidence。ProofWriter的+0.9pp在噪声范围内。 Tiebreak win rate 64.3%显著优于random 50% (binomial p=0.096, N=28)， 但不如D012的100% (4/4)——确认小样本膨胀效应。 策略：report one-sided p<0.10 for combined, 强调effect direction一致性跨两个dataset， ProofWriter作为\\\"boundary condition\\\"证据——当domain FOL结构规则时SICA增益边际化。\\n\\n\\nFOLIO gap从D012的+6.7pp缩小到+3.8pp，因为原始60题中4个tiebreak全胜是小样本运气—— 扩展后tiebreak实例从4增到~15，SICA胜率从100%回归到~65%（部分tie中约束质量不足以区分正确答案）。 ProofWriter维持近零增益(+0.9pp, p=0.41不显著)：PW的FOL结构规则，模型提取的约束同质性高， tie本身就少(C0=0.42 vs FOLIO的0.52)，且tie中约束权重无法有效区分——PW的错误更多来自 推理链遗漏前提而非逻辑矛盾。Combined bootstrap p=0.088落在0.05-0.15区间： 单侧可argue方向性证据(p<0.10)，但双侧检验不显著(p=0.176)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"K=6,8,12,16,20 sensitivity on D012's 60 questions, analyzing tiebreak frequency and SICA gap as function of K\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k6_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k6_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n      \"k6_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"k6_tie_count\": 6,\n      \"k6_c0\": 0.48,\n      \"k8_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n      \"k8_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n      \"k8_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"k8_tie_count\": 5,\n      \"k8_c0\": 0.5,\n      \"k10_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n      \"k10_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n      \"k10_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"k10_tie_count\": 4,\n      \"k10_c0\": 0.533,\n      \"k12_sica_acc\": 0.75,\n      \"k12_sc_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k12_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"k12_tie_count\": 3,\n      \"k12_c0\": 0.55,\n      \"k16_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n      \"k16_sc_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k16_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"k16_tie_count\": 2,\n      \"k16_c0\": 0.58,\n      \"k20_sica_acc\": 0.75,\n      \"k20_sc_acc\": 0.733,\n      \"k20_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"k20_tie_count\": 2,\n      \"k20_c0\": 0.6,\n      \"k_gap_correlation_r\": 0.52,\n      \"k_gap_correlation_p\": 0.29,\n      \"odd_k_check_k9_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"odd_k_check_k11_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"wall_time_hours\": 4.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: K Sensitivity Analysis (N=60)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"K\",\n          \"SC_Acc\",\n          \"SICA_Acc\",\n          \"Gap_pp\",\n          \"Ties\",\n          \"Tie_SICA_Wins\",\n          \"C0\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            6,\n            70.0,\n            71.7,\n            \"+1.7\",\n            6,\n            4,\n            0.48\n          ],\n          [\n            8,\n            70.0,\n            73.3,\n            \"+3.3\",\n            5,\n            4,\n            0.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"10*\",\n            70.0,\n            73.3,\n            \"+3.3\",\n            4,\n            4,\n            0.53\n          ],\n          [\n            12,\n            71.7,\n            75.0,\n            \"+3.3\",\n            3,\n            3,\n            0.55\n          ],\n          [\n            16,\n            71.7,\n            73.3,\n            \"+1.7\",\n            2,\n            2,\n            0.58\n          ],\n          [\n            20,\n            73.3,\n            75.0,\n            \"+1.7\",\n            2,\n            2,\n            0.6\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Odd K Control\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"K\",\n          \"SC_Acc\",\n          \"SICA_Acc\",\n          \"Gap_pp\",\n          \"Ties\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            9,\n            70.0,\n            70.0,\n            \"0.0\",\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            11,\n            71.7,\n            71.7,\n            \"0.0\",\n            0\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"K消融的核心价值不是找最优K，而是mechanistic proof：odd K → 0 gap确认SICA的 entire gain来自tiebreak resolution，非其他pathway。这是defense against reviewer \\\"SICA只是噪声\\\"的strongest evidence——噪声不会在odd/even间产生系统性差异。 Non-monotonicity (K=16 gap < K=12 gap)因为高K时tie概率指数下降， 不损害论文claims——反而支持\\\"SICA operates specifically on ties\\\"的precision。 r=0.52不够strong predictor，在论文中报告为\\\"directional\\\"而非\\\"predictive\\\"。\\n\\n\\nK消融方向正确但非单调：偶数K有tiebreak可能（结构性），奇数K几乎无精确tie。 K=8和K=10(D012原始)表现最好——K足够大产生diversity但tie概率尚可。 K=6时tie最多(6个)因为6:0/5:1/4:2/3:3分布中3:3概率~31%（二项分布近似）， 但每个tie只有6条trace的约束信息，解析力弱，SICA只赢4/6。 K=16/20时tie极少（精确8:8或10:10概率<5%），SICA几乎无用武之地—— 但SC本身准确率上升（更多vote稳定了majority）。 相关性r=0.52说明K与gap有正方向关联但p=0.29（仅5个点），不能claim统计关系。 核心发现：SICA benefit的来源确实是tiebreaking——在odd K实验中gap精确归零， 这是mechanistic validation而非statistical claim。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"CPU reanalysis: SICA vs SC-random-tiebreak vs SC-alphabetical on all 60 D012 questions\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sc_deterministic_acc\": 0.7,\n      \"sc_random_acc_mean\": 0.717,\n      \"sc_random_acc_std\": 0.023,\n      \"sica_acc\": 0.733,\n      \"sica_vs_deterministic_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"sica_vs_random_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"random_vs_deterministic_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"sica_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.22,\n      \"tiebreak_sica_correct\": 3,\n      \"tiebreak_random_expected_correct\": 2.0,\n      \"tiebreak_deterministic_correct\": 1,\n      \"total_ties\": 4,\n      \"n_questions\": 60\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Tiebreak Baseline Comparison (D012, N=60)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"Gap_vs_SICA\",\n          \"Ties_Correct\",\n          \"p_vs_SICA\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SC-Deterministic\",\n            \"70.0%\",\n            \"-3.3pp\",\n            \"1/4\",\n            0.317\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SC-Random (mean)\",\n            \"71.7%\",\n            \"-1.7pp\",\n            \"2.0/4\",\n            0.22\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SICA\",\n            \"73.3%\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"3/4\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这个实验对论文framing至关重要：必须承认SC-random是比SC-deterministic更公平的baseline。 SICA vs random在D012上不显著，但在exp-001的expanded data(28 ties, 64.3% win rate)上 binomial test给p=0.096——边缘但可报告。论文策略：(1)承认deterministic baseline inflates gap， (2)报告vs random的gap和p值transparently，(3)argue即使vs random，64.3% win rate 在repeated application中有practical value，(4)odd/even K实验作为mechanistic证据 补充statistical weakness。\\n\\n\\nD012有4个tie (6:6 splits)。SC-deterministic在这4个tie中只答对1个(alphabetical bias)。 SC-random期望答对2个(50% per tie × 4 ties)。SICA答对3个(75% win rate on ties)。 所以SICA vs random的gap只有+1.7pp(1个额外正确)，而vs deterministic是+3.3pp(2个额外正确)。 在仅4个tie的small sample上，SICA vs random的p值很高(0.22)——无法统计区分。 但这正是median档的定义：方向正确，统计力不足。需要exp-001的28个tie来获得更好的power。 关键insight：D012报告的+3.3pp gap中，约一半来自deterministic tiebreak的系统性bias (alphabetical偏向错误答案)，另一半来自SICA的真实constraint-based resolution。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on same 60 D012 questions, testing C0-as-predictor hypothesis\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.683,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.65,\n      \"sica_sc_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.633,\n      \"c0_folio\": 0.7,\n      \"c0_proofwriter\": 0.57,\n      \"folio_sica\": 0.733,\n      \"folio_sc\": 0.7,\n      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.633,\n      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.6,\n      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"bootstrap_p_combined\": 0.18,\n      \"tiebreak_instances\": 7,\n      \"tiebreak_sica_wins\": 5,\n      \"tiebreak_win_rate\": 0.714,\n      \"constraint_quality_degradation\": 0.15,\n      \"extraction_failures\": 3,\n      \"wall_time_min\": 35\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Model Scaling Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Params\",\n          \"C0\",\n          \"SC_Acc\",\n          \"SICA_Acc\",\n          \"Gap_pp\",\n          \"Ties\",\n          \"Win_Rate\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n            \"7B\",\n            0.63,\n            65.0,\n            68.3,\n            \"+3.3\",\n            7,\n            0.714\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n            \"14B\",\n            0.53,\n            70.0,\n            73.3,\n            \"+3.3\",\n            4,\n            0.75\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QwQ-32B (reasoning)\",\n            \"32B\",\n            0.036,\n            72.7,\n            72.7,\n            \"0.0\",\n            0,\n            \"N/A\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"7B结果validates Claim 2的direction但complicates Claim 3。C0确实higher且有增益(vs QwQ的0)， 但gap大小不随C0线性增长。论文需将Claim 3从\\\"C0 predicts magnitude\\\"弱化为 \\\"C0 predicts whether SICA will help (binary gate)\\\"——threshold约在C0>20%时有增益， <5%时无增益，但20-70%区间内magnitude由constraint quality而非C0 alone决定。 7B的PW增益是surprise(14B上为0)——可能因为sample size或因为7B的error pattern不同。 不过度interpret，在论文中note为\\\"suggestive but N too small for conclusion\\\"。\\n\\n\\n7B模型更弱→答案更分散→C0从14B的0.53升到0.63(符合0.55-0.70区间)。 更多tie instances(7 vs 14B的4)给SICA更多resolution机会。 但constraint质量下降：7B的FOL提取更noisy(3个extraction failures，约束语义准确率降低)。 净效果：gap_pp=3.3与14B相同(不是更大)——higher C0带来更多opportunity但lower constraint quality降低per-tie win rate。这验证了C0预测方向(7B有增益)但关系非线性： C0从0.53→0.63(+19%)，gap从3.3→3.3(+0%)，因为constraint quality是confounding factor。 ProofWriter在7B上意外出现+3.3pp——因为7B在PW上错误更多且更diverse(不像14B那样 一致性地犯同一种错误)，给SICA提供了differentiation空间。但N=30, p=0.18不显著。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"Cross-model C0 vs SICA-SC gap scatter plot and correlation analysis\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"data_points\": 8,\n      \"models_included\": [\n        \"Qwen2.5-7B\",\n        \"Qwen2.5-14B\",\n        \"QwQ-32B\"\n      ],\n      \"k_values_included\": [\n        6,\n        8,\n        10,\n        12,\n        16,\n        20\n      ],\n      \"pearson_r\": 0.58,\n      \"pearson_p\": 0.13,\n      \"spearman_rho\": 0.64,\n      \"spearman_p\": 0.086,\n      \"binary_gate_accuracy\": 1.0,\n      \"binary_gate_threshold_c0\": 0.2,\n      \"above_threshold_mean_gap\": 2.6,\n      \"below_threshold_mean_gap\": 0.0,\n      \"r_within_instruction_models\": 0.41\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: C0 Diagnostic Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"K\",\n          \"C0\",\n          \"Gap_pp\",\n          \"Regime\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"QwQ-32B\",\n            10,\n            0.036,\n            0.0,\n            \"degenerate\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B-Instruct\",\n            6,\n            0.48,\n            1.7,\n            \"active\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B-Instruct\",\n            8,\n            0.5,\n            3.3,\n            \"active\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B-Instruct\",\n            10,\n            0.53,\n            3.3,\n            \"active\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B-Instruct\",\n            12,\n            0.55,\n            3.3,\n            \"active\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B-Instruct\",\n            16,\n            0.58,\n            1.7,\n            \"active\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B-Instruct\",\n            20,\n            0.6,\n            1.7,\n            \"active\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"7B-Instruct\",\n            10,\n            0.63,\n            3.3,\n            \"active\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C0 validation的核心结论：C0是excellent binary classifier (reasoning vs instruction regime) 但poor quantitative predictor within the active regime。论文应present C0 as \\\"practitioner decision tool\\\"——compute C0 on small pilot (5-10 questions), if <10% don't deploy SICA, if >20% SICA will likely help。不claim C0 predicts how much it helps。 这是median档的typical outcome：方向性insight成立但quantitative precision不足。\\n\\n\\n跨所有模型和K值，共8个独立数据点(7B×1, 14B×6 K values, QwQ×1)。 Pearson r=0.58主要由QwQ的极端点(C0≈0.04, gap=0)驱动——去掉QwQ后 只在instruction models间r=0.41(weak)。这说明C0作为binary gate很强 (C0>20% → 有增益, <5% → 无增益, accuracy=100%)，但作为magnitude predictor很弱。 Spearman rho=0.64稍好因为不假设线性关系。p=0.086/0.13在边缘—— 8个点的power本身就不够做strong correlation claim。 这决定了Claim 3在论文中的framing：diagnostic gate而非quantitative predictor。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on 60 questions for scaling curve\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.783,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.767,\n      \"sica_sc_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.35,\n      \"folio_sica\": 0.867,\n      \"folio_sc\": 0.833,\n      \"folio_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.7,\n      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.7,\n      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"tiebreak_instances\": 2,\n      \"tiebreak_sica_wins\": 1,\n      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.35,\n      \"wall_time_min\": 180\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: Full Scaling Curve\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Type\",\n          \"Params\",\n          \"C0\",\n          \"SC_Acc\",\n          \"SICA_Acc\",\n          \"Gap_pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n            \"instruction\",\n            \"7B\",\n            0.63,\n            65.0,\n            68.3,\n            \"+3.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n            \"instruction\",\n            \"14B\",\n            0.53,\n            70.0,\n            73.3,\n            \"+3.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ\",\n            \"instruction\",\n            \"72B\",\n            0.35,\n            76.7,\n            78.3,\n            \"+1.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QwQ-32B\",\n            \"reasoning\",\n            \"32B\",\n            0.04,\n            72.7,\n            72.7,\n            \"0.0\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"72B填充了scaling curve但statistical power极弱。Camera-ready decision： 如果72B支持narrative(C0随size降)则include as one data point in Fig 9。 如果reviewer要求removal(not significant)可safely drop。不是essential evidence。 Key insight for paper：instruction model scaling是C0的continuous axis， reasoning model training是discontinuous regime shift——architecture > scale for C0。\\n\\n\\n72B是instruction model但更强→更self-consistent→C0降到0.35(14B的0.53和QwQ的0.036之间)。 SC baseline更高(76.7% vs 14B的70.0%)——stronger model少犯错。 Ties更少(仅2个)因为72B的majority更decisive。SICA仅赢1/2 ties，gap=1.7pp。 bootstrap p=0.35完全不显著(N=60, 仅1题差异)。 这对论文的价值：confirms scaling trend (bigger instruction model → lower C0 → less SICA benefit)， 支撑\\\"instruction model size是operating regime的gradual axis\\\"的narrative。 但统计上是noise——camera-ready inclusion取决于是否加强story还是dilute it。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n    \"description\": \"Qualitative analysis of 5-10 representative questions from exp-001 expanded data\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"questions_analyzed\": 8,\n      \"categories\": {\n        \"sica_correct_tie_won\": 3,\n        \"sica_correct_tie_lost\": 1,\n        \"non_tie_agreement\": 3,\n        \"extraction_failure\": 1\n      },\n      \"findings\": {\n        \"constraints_semantic_accuracy\": 0.72,\n        \"excluded_correspond_to_errors\": 0.67,\n        \"constraint_redundancy_rate\": 0.45,\n        \"meaningful_weight_differentiation\": 0.625\n      },\n      \"case_highlights\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"SICA win — correct constraint weighting\",\n          \"description\": \"FOLIO q47: 6:6 tie, correct answer's traces produce 12 unique non-contradictory constraints vs 8 for incorrect answer. MaxSAT weight correctly resolves.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"SICA loss — noisy extraction\",\n          \"description\": \"FOLIO q82: 6:6 tie, incorrect answer has more constraints due to verbose but flawed reasoning chain. Quantity overwhelms quality.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"Non-tie validation\",\n          \"description\": \"PW q33: 8:2 majority correct, SICA confirms — excluded constraints (2) both from minority incorrect traces.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Case studies在median档是论文的critical补充——当statistical evidence是borderline时， mechanistic transparency builds reviewer trust。Strategy：选最clean的SICA-win case 作为motivating example(可能放Section 1)，选一个failure case放Section 5 limitations。 Constraint quality = 72% accuracy confirms SICA不是\\\"optimal\\\"——future work可improve extraction quality (better prompting, verification step) for stronger gains。 这也explains为什么C0 alone不predict gap magnitude：constraint quality是hidden variable。\\n\\n\\nMedian档的constraint quality是\\\"good enough to beat random but not reliably correct\\\"。 72%语义准确率意味着约28%的约束是noisy或错误的——这解释了为什么tiebreak win rate是 64-75%而非接近100%。Excluded constraints 67%对应真实推理错误——有意义但不完美。 45%冗余率说明不同traces经常提取相同约束(同一推理步骤)，constraint diversity比trace diversity低。 Case studies的价值：为reviewer提供\\\"mechanistic understanding\\\"的concrete evidence， 补充纯statistical evidence的不足。一个好的SICA-win case + 一个failure case = honest presentation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Wall-time breakdown per phase on exp-001 data\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"avg_total_time_per_question_s\": 58.2,\n      \"breakdown\": {\n        \"generation_s\": 42.5,\n        \"generation_pct\": 73.0,\n        \"constraint_extraction_s\": 12.8,\n        \"constraint_extraction_pct\": 22.0,\n        \"maxsat_solving_s\": 0.3,\n        \"maxsat_solving_pct\": 0.5,\n        \"answer_aggregation_s\": 2.6,\n        \"answer_aggregation_pct\": 4.5\n      },\n      \"sc_equivalent_time_s\": 42.5,\n      \"sica_overhead_vs_sc_pct\": 37.0,\n      \"sica_overhead_absolute_s\": 15.7,\n      \"marginal_cost_per_question_extraction_only\": \"$0.003\",\n      \"total_run_cost_212q\": \"$0.64\",\n      \"maxsat_timeout_rate\": 0.005,\n      \"batch_throughput_questions_per_hour\": 62\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: Computational Overhead Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Phase\",\n          \"Time_s\",\n          \"Pct_Total\",\n          \"Shared_with_SC\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Trace Generation (K=10)\",\n            42.5,\n            \"73%\",\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Constraint Extraction\",\n            12.8,\n            \"22%\",\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MaxSAT Solving\",\n            0.3,\n            \"0.5%\",\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Answer Aggregation\",\n            2.6,\n            \"4.5%\",\n            \"Partial\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Total\",\n            58.2,\n            \"100%\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SICA Marginal Overhead\",\n            15.7,\n            \"37%*\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Overhead analysis的framing：不是\\\"SICA costs 37% more\\\"而是\\\"SICA adds 16s per question on top of generation that SC already requires\\\"。Dollar cost framing($0.003/question marginal) 更compelling than percentage。Reviewer可能ask \\\"why not just increase K instead of adding extraction overhead?\\\"——answer from exp-002: increasing K alone doesn't help when ties still occur and random resolution is needed; SICA resolves ties principally regardless of K。\\n\\nGeneration (K=10 traces)是bottleneck且SC也需要这步——所以SICA的marginal overhead 仅是constraint extraction(22%)和MaxSAT(0.5%)。MaxSAT solving几乎instant(<1s per problem) 因为constraint数量小(~30 unique per problem)，Z3处理trivial。 Extraction是主要overhead source：每条trace需要LLM call提取FOL(或regex parsing)。 37% overhead在\\\"是否worth it\\\"的argument中是reasonable——如果gain是+2-4pp on a benchmark where random gets 50% and state-of-art gets 75%，+2pp是meaningful improvement at moderate cost。 但reviewer可能argue\\\"37% more compute for 2pp gain is not practical\\\"—— defense: (1) generation cost is sunk (user already runs SC), (2) extraction可batch/parallelize, (3) marginal dollar cost <$1 for full benchmark run。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":667,"startLine":1,"totalLines":667}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01X4Y2j9RAbo7tNx29sxCtoe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0176kF3P2RphYycenpMs568h","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T051642/median/paper_framing.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11147,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11147},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"46b79754-4c0b-40a8-861c-f0eb2429fe5e","uuid":"50fd8062-1edc-46ba-8884-22d815b96d3d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0176kF3P2RphYycenpMs568h","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — symb_invariant_consensus\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25)\n5\t- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (Aug 1)\n6\t- Deadline: May 25, 2026 (ARR submission)\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims (3 条)\n9\t1. **Principled Tiebreaking**: SICA resolves Self-Consistency voting ties through symbolic constraint weighting, achieving higher accuracy than arbitrary tiebreak rules on logic reasoning benchmarks (FOLIO +6.7pp, combined +3.3pp on 60 questions; target: statistically significant on 200+ questions).\n10\t2. **Operating Regime Characterization**: The effectiveness of symbolic consensus is conditional on trace diversity — SICA adds value when model outputs are diverse (instruction models, C0>20%) but provably degenerates to SC when models are self-consistent (reasoning models, C0<5%). This is a model property, not a task property.\n11\t3. **C0 as Practical Diagnostic**: Multi-candidate rate (C0) serves as a zero-cost predictor of whether SICA deployment will yield gains over SC, enabling practitioners to decide without running full symbolic analysis.\n12\t\n13\t## Core Insight\n14\tSymbolic constraint consensus doesn't uniformly improve reasoning — it specifically helps when there IS disagreement to resolve. We provide the first systematic study of WHEN symbolic consensus adds value, revealing that model architecture (reasoning vs instruction) determines the operating regime. This transforms SICA from \"yet another ensemble method\" into \"a method with formally characterizable applicability boundaries.\"\n15\t\n16\t## Story Spine\n17\t- **Problem**: Self-Consistency (SC) aggregates LLM reasoning paths via majority voting but treats all chains as opaque votes, discarding the logical structure within them. When votes are tied, SC falls back to arbitrary rules (alphabetical, random) with no principled resolution.\n18\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: SC (Wang et al. 2023) — pure voting, no reasoning structure. USC (Chen et al. 2023) — universal SC, still voting-based. None exploit the formal logical structure within reasoning traces for consensus, and none characterize when symbolic methods help vs. don't.\n19\t- **Our framing**: SICA extracts first-order logic constraints from reasoning traces and uses weighted partial MAX-SAT to find the globally consistent answer. We show this provides principled tiebreaking (75% win rate on ties vs 25% for SC) but only when trace diversity exists. We formalize this as C0 (multi-candidate rate) and show it's governed by model type, not task type.\n20\t- **Headline result template**: \"On FOLIO, SICA achieves 80.0% vs SC's 73.3% (+6.7pp) with Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct. On the same benchmarks with QwQ-32B, SICA degenerates to SC (C0=3.6%), revealing that symbolic consensus effectiveness is governed by trace diversity, not task difficulty.\"\n21\t\n22\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defensive Experiments\n23\t1. **\"Gains not statistically significant\"** → exp-001: Expand to 200+ questions for statistical power\n24\t2. **\"Only a better tiebreaker, not worth the overhead\"** → exp-002: K sensitivity showing benefit pattern; exp-009: overhead analysis\n25\t3. **\"Only one non-reasoning model\"** → exp-004: Add Qwen2.5-7B for scaling; exp-007: 72B-AWQ for camera-ready\n26\t4. **\"ProofWriter shows 0pp gain\"** → Domain analysis in exp-001 expanded results\n27\t5. **\"Random tiebreak baseline closes the gap\"** → exp-003: Direct SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic comparison\n28\t6. **\"Why not just use a reasoning model?\"** → exp-005: QwQ-32B data shows reasoning models are self-consistent (don't need consensus improvement), but instruction models (cheaper, more deployed) benefit from SICA\n29\t\n30\t## Venue Fit Risks\n31\t- EMNLP: Contribution may feel narrow if framed as ONLY tiebreaking. Primary intellectual contribution is the \"operating regime characterization\" — the tiebreaking mechanism is evidence, not the claim.\n32\t- Cross-discipline: Combines formal logic (MAX-SAT) with NLP (LLM reasoning). MAX-SAT needs clear explanation for NLP audience.\n33\t- Negative results: QwQ-32B data must be presented as insight (\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Degenerate?\"), not failure.\n34\t- Statistical power: 60-question results are fragile. 200+ question expansion is prerequisite for credible submission.\n35\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"46b79754-4c0b-40a8-861c-f0eb2429fe5e","uuid":"a31c7550-8ea1-4142-803c-8f575e28ca0d","timestamp":"2026-05-16T05:33:30.368Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T051642/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — symb_invariant_consensus\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25)\n- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (Aug 1)\n- Deadline: May 25, 2026 (ARR submission)\n\n## Core Claims (3 条)\n1. **Principled Tiebreaking**: SICA resolves Self-Consistency voting ties through symbolic constraint weighting, achieving higher accuracy than arbitrary tiebreak rules on logic reasoning benchmarks (FOLIO +6.7pp, combined +3.3pp on 60 questions; target: statistically significant on 200+ questions).\n2. **Operating Regime Characterization**: The effectiveness of symbolic consensus is conditional on trace diversity — SICA adds value when model outputs are diverse (instruction models, C0>20%) but provably degenerates to SC when models are self-consistent (reasoning models, C0<5%). This is a model property, not a task property.\n3. **C0 as Practical Diagnostic**: Multi-candidate rate (C0) serves as a zero-cost predictor of whether SICA deployment will yield gains over SC, enabling practitioners to decide without running full symbolic analysis.\n\n## Core Insight\nSymbolic constraint consensus doesn't uniformly improve reasoning — it specifically helps when there IS disagreement to resolve. We provide the first systematic study of WHEN symbolic consensus adds value, revealing that model architecture (reasoning vs instruction) determines the operating regime. This transforms SICA from \"yet another ensemble method\" into \"a method with formally characterizable applicability boundaries.\"\n\n## Story Spine\n- **Problem**: Self-Consistency (SC) aggregates LLM reasoning paths via majority voting but treats all chains as opaque votes, discarding the logical structure within them. When votes are tied, SC falls back to arbitrary rules (alphabetical, random) with no principled resolution.\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: SC (Wang et al. 2023) — pure voting, no reasoning structure. USC (Chen et al. 2023) — universal SC, still voting-based. None exploit the formal logical structure within reasoning traces for consensus, and none characterize when symbolic methods help vs. don't.\n- **Our framing**: SICA extracts first-order logic constraints from reasoning traces and uses weighted partial MAX-SAT to find the globally consistent answer. We show this provides principled tiebreaking (75% win rate on ties vs 25% for SC) but only when trace diversity exists. We formalize this as C0 (multi-candidate rate) and show it's governed by model type, not task type.\n- **Headline result template**: \"On FOLIO, SICA achieves 80.0% vs SC's 73.3% (+6.7pp) with Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct. On the same benchmarks with QwQ-32B, SICA degenerates to SC (C0=3.6%), revealing that symbolic consensus effectiveness is governed by trace diversity, not task difficulty.\"\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defensive Experiments\n1. **\"Gains not statistically significant\"** → exp-001: Expand to 200+ questions for statistical power\n2. **\"Only a better tiebreaker, not worth the overhead\"** → exp-002: K sensitivity showing benefit pattern; exp-009: overhead analysis\n3. **\"Only one non-reasoning model\"** → exp-004: Add Qwen2.5-7B for scaling; exp-007: 72B-AWQ for camera-ready\n4. **\"ProofWriter shows 0pp gain\"** → Domain analysis in exp-001 expanded results\n5. **\"Random tiebreak baseline closes the gap\"** → exp-003: Direct SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic comparison\n6. **\"Why not just use a reasoning model?\"** → exp-005: QwQ-32B data shows reasoning models are self-consistent (don't need consensus improvement), but instruction models (cheaper, more deployed) benefit from SICA\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n- EMNLP: Contribution may feel narrow if framed as ONLY tiebreaking. Primary intellectual contribution is the \"operating regime characterization\" — the tiebreaking mechanism is evidence, not the claim.\n- Cross-discipline: Combines formal logic (MAX-SAT) with NLP (LLM reasoning). MAX-SAT needs clear explanation for NLP audience.\n- Negative results: QwQ-32B data must be presented as insight (\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Degenerate?\"), not failure.\n- Statistical power: 60-question results are fragile. 200+ question expansion is prerequisite for credible submission.\n","numLines":35,"startLine":1,"totalLines":35}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015Ph9ceNnLZcCrY7gGxaXxs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a thorough understanding of all the experiments and the paper framing. Let me synthesize this into a complete LaTeX paper. Let me check the output directory exists first.\n\nKey experiments to cover:\n1. **sica_expanded_14b** - Table 2 (expanded results N=212) + Table 3 (tiebreak resolution)\n2. **sica_k_ablation_14b** - Table 4 (K sensitivity) + Table 5 (odd K control)\n3. **tiebreak_baseline_analysis** - Table 6 (tiebreak baseline comparison)\n4. **sica_7b_scaling** - Table 7 (model scaling)\n\n\n5. **c0_diagnostic_validation** - Table 8 (C0 diagnostic)\n6. **sica_72b_awq** - Table 9 (full scaling curve)\n7. **constraint_quality_case_studies** - qualitative analysis\n8. **overhead_analysis** - Table 10 (computational overhead)\n\nThe paper's core narrative emphasizes characterizing when SICA works rather than claiming broad improvements—framing results as consistent directional gains, establishing the operating regime where the method succeeds, and using ProofWriter's zero gain as evidence of domain-specificity. This is fundamentally a characterization study about understanding the conditions under which the approach is effective.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11353,"cache_read_input_tokens":22988,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11353},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"46b79754-4c0b-40a8-861c-f0eb2429fe5e","uuid":"1bc43eeb-9f06-42ca-8b44-eafafd0c4a92"}
